Tinglan Web 0.31.2 (standalone Web application)

This Web adaptation and its shared Kotlin module are distributed under GPL-3.0,
consistent with the ArchiveTune application from which shared policies are built.
The complete license is included in LICENSE (LICENSE.txt in the Web build).

NetEase Cloud Music AFP engine: the same byte-pinned WebAssembly from the native
application's official extension 1.0.4 reference is included in recognition/.
Original vendor attribution and hashes are in recognition/NOTICE.txt. The Web
binding adapter replaces generated function naming with ordinary closures and
exports a module factory; it does not require JavaScript eval. Vendor rights
and original attribution remain with NetEase Cloud Music.

Shared files are preserved with attribution in shared/kotlin/:
  moe/rukamori/archivetune/lyrics/LyricsLineInteraction.kt
  moe/rukamori/archivetune/lyrics/LyricsRefreshPolicy.kt
  moe/rukamori/archivetune/ui/component/PlayingIndicatorMotion.kt
  moe/rukamori/archivetune/musicrecognition/LocalAudioFingerprint.kt
  moe/rukamori/archivetune/ui/player/QueueViewport.kt
  moe/rukamori/archivetune/ui/component/PlayerSlider.kt
ArchiveTune (2026), Rukamori and contributors; existing source notices and licenses
are preserved in the shared sources and shared/LICENSE.

Kotlin compiler, standard library and Gradle plugin: JetBrains and contributors,
Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin
Binaryen (build-time Wasm optimizer): WebAssembly contributors, Apache License 2.0,
https://github.com/WebAssembly/binaryen
Gradle wrapper/build tool: Gradle contributors, Apache License 2.0,
